# An RLXU container, 416 bytes, built by mkfw2 1.0 from
# sample-payload.hex with the PUBLISHED development seed (32 x 0x42),
# version 3, load/entry 0x80500000, recipe 3685a3a4.  Hex rather than
# binary so a reader can diff it and so nothing binary enters the tree
# that a reader has to take on trust.  A5 rebuilds it byte for byte; if
# that ever fails, the FORMAT changed and every signed container did too.

